category: Libs
build-depends: cygport doxygen libxml2-devel
sdesc: "Library providing high performance logging, tracing, ipc, and poll (utilities)"
ldesc: "libqb is a library with the primary purpose of providing high-performance,
reusable features for client-server architecture, such as logging, tracing,
inter-process communication (IPC), and polling."
